{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 3873464,
  "courseSlug": "nextjs-react-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Next.js & React - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25145900",
      "title": "Optimizing Images with the \"Next Image\" Component & Feature",
      "lectureOrder": 312,
      "videoOrder": 290,
      "sourceHash": "159705d0d3919bba9defa79758ecdc5f19e53cf5dedde24e08d23a2a9abebba5",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.289,
          "end": 5.27,
          "en": "Optimizing images with Next.js is easy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.27,
          "end": 8.02,
          "en": "Here I'm in the event item component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.02,
          "end": 10.7,
          "en": "which is the component that renders the image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.7,
          "end": 13.11,
          "en": "in that list of event items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.11,
          "end": 15.83,
          "en": "Now, currently we're using the standard image tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.83,
          "end": 17.67,
          "en": "the standard image element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.67,
          "end": 19.5,
          "en": "but for optimizing images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.5,
          "end": 23.1,
          "en": "we can import a component offered by Next.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.1,
          "end": 27.093,
          "en": "the image component from next/image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.34,
          "end": 31.56,
          "en": "Now, this is a special component which we can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.56,
          "end": 34.67,
          "en": "to replace the standard image element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.67,
          "end": 37.27,
          "en": "And when we use that special component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.27,
          "end": 41.94,
          "en": "Next.js will create multiple versions of our image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.94,
          "end": 45.29,
          "en": "on the fly when requests are coming in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.29,
          "end": 49.51,
          "en": "optimize for the operating systems and device sizes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.51,
          "end": 51.45,
          "en": "that are making the request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.45,
          "end": 54.76,
          "en": "And then those generated images will be cached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.76,
          "end": 58.78,
          "en": "for future requests from similar devices.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.78,
          "end": 59.73,
          "en": "So to enable this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.73,
          "end": 61.89,
          "en": "we need to use this image component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.89,
          "end": 64.34,
          "en": "instead of our own image component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.34,
          "end": 67.26,
          "en": "And we can copy over source and alt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.26,
          "end": 71.78999999999999,
          "en": "that also works on that next image component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.78999999999999,
          "end": 75.53999999999999,
          "en": "But now we also need to add two more attributes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.53999999999999,
          "end": 77.28999999999999,
          "en": "two more props here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.28999999999999,
          "end": 80.443,
          "en": "And that's the width and the height attributes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.58,
          "end": 85.75,
          "en": "We need to set those to basically inform Next.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.75,
          "end": 88.48,
          "en": "about the width and height of this image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.48,
          "end": 90.24,
          "en": "And with that, I don't mean",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.24,
          "end": 92.93,
          "en": "the original width and height of the image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.93,
          "end": 97.22999999999999,
          "en": "but the width and height which we need for the image here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.22999999999999,
          "end": 98.9,
          "en": "For determining the width and height,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.9,
          "end": 101.12,
          "en": "we should keep in mind that our image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.12,
          "end": 103.89,
          "en": "is displayed in two possible ways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.89,
          "end": 106.50999999999999,
          "en": "It either takes the full width of the container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.50999999999999,
          "end": 108,
          "en": "on smaller screens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108,
          "end": 112.77000000000001,
          "en": "or just a fraction of the width on bigger screen sizes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.77000000000001,
          "end": 114.85,
          "en": "Because then we have the image on the left side",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.85,
          "end": 117.25999999999999,
          "en": "and the other content on the right side.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117.25999999999999,
          "end": 118.72,
          "en": "Now in the CSS code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 118.72,
          "end": 120.93,
          "en": "we can see this here basically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 120.93,
          "end": 123.59,
          "en": "I'm using Flexbox on the parent container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 123.59,
          "end": 127.92,
          "en": "and on smaller screens status a column Flexbox,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.92,
          "end": 130.483,
          "en": "so items are rendered on top of each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 132.29,
          "end": 133.6,
          "en": "But on bigger screens,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.6,
          "end": 136.65,
          "en": "the items sit next to each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.65,
          "end": 141.65,
          "en": "And then the image has 40% of the width of the overall item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 141.96,
          "end": 143.39,
          "en": "Now, the overall item width",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 143.39,
          "end": 146,
          "en": "is determined by the event-list styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 146,
          "end": 148.693,
          "en": "And there we have a max width of 40 rem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.6,
          "end": 153.6,
          "en": "So overall we have around 640 pixels,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 153.6,
          "end": 156.13,
          "en": "that is what 40 rem are in pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156.13,
          "end": 158.59,
          "en": "As a width for the overall item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 158.59,
          "end": 162.29,
          "en": "And the image has around 40% of that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 162.29,
          "end": 164.92000000000002,
          "en": "Hence here we could try setting width",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 164.92000000000002,
          "end": 168.1,
          "en": "to around 340 pixels maybe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 168.1,
          "end": 171.433,
          "en": "which are roughly 40% of 640.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 172.7,
          "end": 175.07,
          "en": "And set the height to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 175.07,
          "end": 177.71,
          "en": "here we have 10 rem for the image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 177.71,
          "end": 180.38,
          "en": "so that our 160 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 180.38,
          "end": 182.383,
          "en": "So that's the value I will use here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 183.22,
          "end": 185.63,
          "en": "So with that, I'm determining the width and height",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 185.63,
          "end": 189.18,
          "en": "of the image, as it should be loaded on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 189.18,
          "end": 192.43,
          "en": "I'm not setting with an height of the original files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 192.43,
          "end": 196.17000000000002,
          "en": "As you see these files here, have much bigger dimensions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 196.17000000000002,
          "end": 197.503,
          "en": "I'm not using those.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 198.44,
          "end": 200.54,
          "en": "So with that, if we save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 200.54,
          "end": 201.98,
          "en": "and we reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 201.98,
          "end": 204.84,
          "en": "we see our image showing up here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 204.84,
          "end": 206.55,
          "en": "Now it's a little bit too wide.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 206.55,
          "end": 211.49,
          "en": "So I'll actually shrink this to 250 here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 211.49,
          "end": 212.97,
          "en": "and that looks better,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 212.97,
          "end": 215.73,
          "en": "and on a smaller screen, that also works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 215.73,
          "end": 218.48,
          "en": "And the nice thing here now is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 218.48,
          "end": 221.53,
          "en": "that if we now open the developer tools again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 221.53,
          "end": 224.233,
          "en": "and we again empty the cache and hard reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 225.27,
          "end": 228.31,
          "en": "we will see that these images are much smaller.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 228.31,
          "end": 229.36,
          "en": "We see that here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 229.36,
          "end": 233.13,
          "en": "this image is now only 19 kilobytes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 233.13,
          "end": 235.52,
          "en": "instead of the megabytes we had before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 235.52,
          "end": 238.51,
          "en": "So all these images are much smaller.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 238.51,
          "end": 241.07,
          "en": "They are all the fetched as a different type now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 241.07,
          "end": 243.82,
          "en": "As webp here, since I'm using Chrome",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 243.82,
          "end": 246.97,
          "en": "and Chrome supports this optimized image format.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 246.97,
          "end": 248.97,
          "en": "And they also have reduced quality",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 248.97,
          "end": 251.14,
          "en": "to shrink the file size even more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 251.14,
          "end": 253.36,
          "en": "without impacting the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 253.36,
          "end": 255.085,
          "en": "The quality is only reduced such",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 255.085,
          "end": 257.52,
          "en": "that we don't really see it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 257.52,
          "end": 261.33,
          "en": "Now that's working because Next.js, as I explained",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 261.33,
          "end": 264.67,
          "en": "generates optimized images on the fly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 264.67,
          "end": 267.02,
          "en": "Now we can see those generated images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 267.02,
          "end": 269.16,
          "en": "in the .next folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 269.16,
          "end": 270.82,
          "en": "They're in the cache folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 270.82,
          "end": 272.53,
          "en": "We have an images folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 272.53,
          "end": 275,
          "en": "And in there we have a couple of triptych files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 275,
          "end": 277.39,
          "en": "which in the end contained the images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 277.39,
          "end": 280.6,
          "en": "as they are generated by Next.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 280.6,
          "end": 282.71,
          "en": "And these are the optimized images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 282.71,
          "end": 285.18,
          "en": "which are generated when they're needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 285.18,
          "end": 287.94,
          "en": "So they're not generated in advance,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 287.94,
          "end": 290.31,
          "en": "but when a request reaches the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 290.31,
          "end": 293.38,
          "en": "But then they are stored so did future requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 293.38,
          "end": 295.05,
          "en": "from a similar devices",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 295.05,
          "end": 298.36,
          "en": "immediately get that already generated image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 298.36,
          "end": 300.631,
          "en": "And that's there for another very nice feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 300.631,
          "end": 303.41,
          "en": "Next.js has built.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 303.41,
          "end": 305.59,
          "en": "Now besides the size optimizations,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 305.59,
          "end": 307.52,
          "en": "which are of course super important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 307.52,
          "end": 310.85,
          "en": "Those images also have a never nice benefit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 310.85,
          "end": 314.18,
          "en": "or the image component offered by Next.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 314.18,
          "end": 316.35,
          "en": "has another nice benefit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 316.35,
          "end": 318.58,
          "en": "if we're on a smaller screen here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 318.58,
          "end": 320.59,
          "en": "And I then reload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 320.59,
          "end": 322.81,
          "en": "If I clear my network tab,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 322.81,
          "end": 326.91,
          "en": "watch what happens if I increase the screen size,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 326.91,
          "end": 329.76,
          "en": "as it increases you see a new request is made",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 329.76,
          "end": 331.94,
          "en": "for that bottom most image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 331.94,
          "end": 333.55,
          "en": "That request is being made,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 333.55,
          "end": 337.47,
          "en": "because by default images are lazy loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 337.47,
          "end": 339.57,
          "en": "Which means if they're not visible,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 339.57,
          "end": 342.35,
          "en": "Next.js will not download them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 342.35,
          "end": 343.64300000000003,
          "en": "And that's another difference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 343.64300000000003,
          "end": 345.95,
          "en": "to the built in image component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 345.95,
          "end": 349.18,
          "en": "There all images were loaded eagerly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 349.18,
          "end": 352.15999999999997,
          "en": "which means they were loaded all the time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 352.15999999999997,
          "end": 354.71,
          "en": "Now they are only loaded when they're needed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 354.71,
          "end": 358.19,
          "en": "and that further decreases the amount of requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 358.19,
          "end": 359.49,
          "en": "we're making in advance,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 359.49,
          "end": 362.58,
          "en": "and the bandwidth we're taking up with our page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 362.58,
          "end": 364.38,
          "en": "So that's another nice feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 364.38,
          "end": 366.513,
          "en": "We don't load what we don't need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 367.48,
          "end": 370.5,
          "en": "So next/image is a super important component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 370.5,
          "end": 373.55,
          "en": "It allows us to ship production-ready images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 373.55,
          "end": 378.13,
          "en": "and therefore I also wanna use it on the event detail page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
